up to celebrate National Vanilla Ice Cream Day! 🎉🍨 This little kitty is covered in sprinkles and sitting in a waffle cone!\\n\\nWe’re using markers and marker paper, but you can get creative with your colors and toppings. Try rainbow sprinkles, whipped cream, or even a cherry on top! 🍒✨\\n\\n🖍️ Art Supplies Needed:\\nMarkers\\nMarker paper\\n(But feel free to use whatever you have!)\\n\\n👩🎨 Share Your Art:\\nWe’d LOVE to see your sweet creations! 🍦🐱 Share your drawing on Instagram and tag us @artforkidshub for a chance to be featured in our stories!\\n\\n📲 Visit Our Website \\u0026 Shop:\\n🎨 Explore more fun art lessons at https://ArtForKidsHub.com\\n\\n🖌️ AFKH Amazon Store: https://www.amazon.com/shop/artforkidshub\\n📘 Drawing books for offline fun: https://amzn.to/48GUmLd\\n\\n🔔 Join Our AFKH Membership:\\nWant even more awesome drawing lessons? Become a member at https://www.artforkidshub.tv/!\\n\\n👍 Like \\u0026 Subscribe:\\nIf you had fun drawing with us, give this video a big thumbs up and subscribe for more adorable and creative art lessons!\\n#artforkidshub (2025) #howtodraw1b:T142d,\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"How to Draw a Cuteness Overload Chocolate Bar - Easy Step-by-Step for Kids!\\nGet ready for a melty-good art adventure! In this fun \\u0026 easy tutorial, kids of all ages will learn to draw the most adorable chocolate bar ever!\\n\\nThis video will teach you:\\n\\nHow to draw a blocky, yummy-looking chocolate bar with a playful face.\\nAdd cute details like shiny wrappers, delicious textures, and even a bite taken out!\\nSimple drawing techniques perfect for beginners, even if you're a choco-rookie! ✏️\\nFun tips \\u0026 tricks to make your chocolate bar stand out from the rest! ✨\\n\\nGather your supplies:\\n\\nPaper\\nPencil\\nEraser\\nCrayons, markers, or paints (of course!)\\n\\nJoin us on this sweet artistic journey and let's create some melt-in-your-mouth masterpieces!\\n\\n\\nSubscribe, Like, and Share 🙏🙏\\n\\n#artforkids #chocolatebar #howtodraw #easydrawing #stepbystep #cutefood #funart #creativity #drawingforbeginners  #kidsart #chocolateday #cuteeasydrawings #cedfansclub #easydrawings #cutedrawings #draw #drawing #drawingvideo  #howtodraw #drawingtutorial #drawingforkids\\n#easydrawing #watermelonicecream #cutedrawing #cartoondrawing\\n#summerdrawing #toddlerdrawing #kidsactivities\\n\\nRelated Search:\\nChocolate day drawing,\\nStep by step drawing,\\ncute drawing,\\ndrawing tutorial,\\ndrawing easy,\\ndrawing art,\\ndrawing and coloring,\\nDraw,  \\nDrawings,\\nBasic Drawings,\\nHow to Draw,\\nHow to Draw good,\\nHow to Draw Cute,\\nDraw so Cute Drawings,\\nVery Easy Drawings,\\nSimple Drawings,\\nDrawings Lessons,\\nLine Drawings,\\nHow to Color,\\nHow to Colour,\\nCute Drawings.\\nEasy Drawings,\\nSimple Drawings,\\nVery Easy Drawing,\\nDrawings for Beginners,\\nDraw something Easy,\\nWhat to Draw,\\nWhat to Draw Today,\\nSomething easy to Draw,\\nDisegno passo dopo passo,\\nsimpatico disegno,\\ntutorial di disegno,\\ndisegno facile,\\narte del disegno,\\ndisegnare e colorare,\\nDisegnare,\\nDisegni,\\nDisegni di base,\\nCome disegnare,\\nCome disegnare bene,\\nCome disegnare carino,\\nDisegna disegni così carini,\\nDisegni molto facili,\\nDisegni semplici,\\nLezioni di disegno,\\nDisegni al tratto,\\nCome colorare,\\nCome colorare,\\nDisegni carini.\\nDisegni facili,\\nDisegni semplici,\\nDisegno molto semplice,\\nDisegni per principianti,\\nDisegna qualcosa di facile,\\nCosa disegnare,\\nCosa disegnare oggi,\\nQualcosa di facile da disegnare,\\nSchritt für Schritt zeichnen,\\nsüße Zeichnung,\\nZeichnungs-Tutorial,\\neinfach zeichnen,\\nKunst zeichnen,\\nZeichnen und Ausmalen,\\nZiehen,\\nZeichnungen,\\nGrundlegende Zeichnungen,\\nWie man zeichnet,\\nWie zeichnet man gut,\\nWie zeichnet man süß,\\nZeichne so süße Zeichnungen,\\nSehr einfache Zeichnungen,\\nEinfache Zeichnungen,\\nZeichenunterricht,\\nStrichzeichnungen,\\nWie man färbt,\\nWie man färbt,\\nNette Zeichnungen.\\nEinf