:120,\"height\":90},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wy2-3BxdtYY/mqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":320,\"height\":180},\"high\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wy2-3BxdtYY/hqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":480,\"height\":360},\"standard\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wy2-3BxdtYY/sddefault.jpg\",\"width\":640,\"height\":480},\"maxres\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wy2-3BxdtYY/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720}}},\"categoryLabel\":\"Creativity\"}],[\"$\",\"$L10\",\"7q3Y6cyE0LI\",{\"video\":{\"id\":\"7q3Y6cyE0LI\",\"title\":\"How To Draw A Teddy Bear - US National Teddy Bear Day\",\"description\":\"Happy national teddy bear day! To celebrate, we thought it would be a lot of learning how to draw a teddy bear! We hope you have fun celebrating by following along with us. Art Supplies ~ This is a list of the supplies we used, but feel free to use whatever you have in your home or classroom.\\n~Sharpie (or something to draw with)\\n~Paper (we use marker paper)\\n~Markers to color with (we use Bianyo)\\n~Colored pencils (sometimes we also use Prismacolor colored pencils)\\nVisit our art supply page for more information about the supplies used in this lesson.\\n🎨   VISIT OUR AMAZON ART SUPPLY STORE https://www.amazon.com/shop/artforkidshub\\n👩🎨  JOIN OUR ART HUB MEMBERSHIP! VISIT https://www.artforkidshub.tv/\\n📺   SUBSCRIBE to our channel here http://bit.ly/afksubscribe\\n\\n📷  POST your child's artwork to:\\nFACEBOOK http://facebook.com/artforkidshub\\nINSTAGRAM http://instagram.com/artforkidshub\\n\\n#howtodraw #artforkidshub\",\"channelTitle\":\"Art for Kids Hub\",\"channelId\":\"UC5XMF3Inoi8R9nSI8ChOsdQ\",\"publishedAt\":\"2022-09-09T13:00:08Z\",\"duration\":\"5:30\",\"thumbnails\":{\"default\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7q3Y6cyE0LI/default.jpg\",\"width\":120,\"height\":90},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7q3Y6cyE0LI/mqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":320,\"height\":180},\"high\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7q3Y6cyE0LI/hqdefault.